ressure without a new atomic verify boundary.\n\nACTION: dead_letter\n\nThis issue is being dead-lettered as intake-only evidence and rerouted to the existing Web UI lanes above. Future execution/discussion should happen on #501 for umbrella scope, #8183 for MVP contract scope, and the active PR lanes for concrete implementation/docs artifacts.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4234819299/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4235804243", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852#issuecomment-4235804243", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852", "id": 4235804243, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G878eT5T", "user": {"login": "EKKOLearnAI", "id": 152005280, "node_id": "U_kgDOCQ9qoA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/152005280?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI", "html_url": "https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EKKOLearnAI/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-13T10:50:40Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-13T10:50:40Z", "body": "Hey! There's actually another solid option worth considering: **[EKKOLearnAI/hermes-web-ui](https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/hermes-web-ui)** \ud83c\udf89\n\nIt's a standalone Web Dashboard for Hermes Agent that you can install globally via npm:\n\n```bash\nnpm install -g hermes-web-ui\nhermes-web-ui start\n```\n\n**Key features:**\n- \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Clean web dashboard for managing Hermes from the browser\n- \ud83d\udcf1 Mobile responsive \u2014 access from anywhere\n- \ud83d\udcca Session monitoring, cron job management, connected platform status\n- \ud83d\udd27 No extra server setup needed, just one command to start\n\nAs a daily Hermes user, I built this because I wanted a lightweight way to monitor and control my Hermes instance without being tied to the CLI. It's open source and actively maintained.\n\nHappy to discuss integration possibilities or take feedback!", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4235804243/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4237340631", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852#issuecomment-4237340631", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852", "id": 4237340631, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G878kK_X", "user": {"login": "mlosun", "id": 7459954, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc0NTk5NTQ=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7459954?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun", "html_url": "https://github.com/mlosun", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mlosun/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-13T14:54:27Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-13T14:54:27Z", "body": "I've also been searching for a suitable web UI solution. There are already numerous options in the community, and I've tried several of them. Ultimately, I found that https://github.com/nesquena/hermes-webui offers the best experience for me so far. It would be fantastic if this web UI could be integrated into the official project.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4237340631/reactions", "total_count": 3, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 1, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4247762916", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852#issuecomment-4247762916", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852", "id": 4247762916, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G879L7fk", "user": {"login": "nesquena", "id": 6511, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY1MTE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6511?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena", "html_url": "https://github.com/nesquena", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nesquena/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-14T22:58:55Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-14T23:03:03Z", "body": "I just wanted to chime in here to say that I'd be more than happy to donate my already fairly substantial WebUI (https://github.com/nesquena/hermes-webui/issues) to Hermes and Nous. I would also be willing to stay on as an active contributor!\n\nMy hope is to make Hermes Agent accessible to people that don't want to use the command line, by making this an end to end web, mobile and desktop app experience for Hermes as a drop in alternative UI experience \n\nI'm already almost there! Let me know if you all would be interested!\n\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f73eb7ab-a362-4469-82c0-44895aace8af)", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4247762916/reactions", "total_count": 2, "+1": 2, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4266248985", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852#issuecomment-4266248985", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/8852", "id": 4266248985, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G87-ScsZ", "user": {"